helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3159201				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OFA_HYPERLINK_DLG\"\>Use the \<emph\>Hyperlink\</emph\> Bar to create and edit the hyperlinks in your documents, and to enter criteria for searches using the available Internet search engines.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136				0	gu	You can open and close the \<emph\>Hyperlink\</emph\> Bar in \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Hyperlink Bar\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
