helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0650.xhp\" name=\"Java Platform Support\"\>Java Platform Support\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	gu	$[officename] supports the Java platform for running applications, applets and components based on the JavaBeans architecture.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	gu	The Java platform support needs to be activated under $[officename] to run Java applications.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
