helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146948				0	gu	List of user-defined formats				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3150093				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_FLD_DB:LB_DBFORMAT\"\>Lists the available user-defined formats.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FF				0	gu	Printing a form letter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN10803				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>When you print a document that contains database fields, a dialog asks you if you want to print a form letter. If you answer Yes, the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/01150000.xhp\"\>Mail Merge\</link\> dialog opens where you can select the database records to print.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
