helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156030				0	gu	Macros				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156043				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specify the macro that executes when the selected event occurs.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156058				0	gu	Frames allow you to link certain events to a function that then decides if the event is handled by $[officename] Writer or by the function. See the $[officename] Basic Help for more information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149284				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:TABPAGE:RID_SFX_TP_MACROASSIGN\"\>Lists the $[officename] program and any open $[officename] document.\</ahelp\> Within this list, select the location where you want to save the macros.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3148458				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:TABPAGE:RID_SFX_TP_MACROASSIGN\"\>Lists the available macros. Select the macro that you want to assign to the selected event, and then click \<emph\>Assign\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3145197				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SFX_SMALLTP_MACROASSIGN:PB_ASSIGN\"\>Assigns the selected to the selected event.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3150882				0	gu	\<variable id=\"aufheb\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SFX_SMALLTP_MACROASSIGN:PB_DELETE\"\>Removes the macro assignment from the selected entry.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
