helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_emabod.xhp	0	help	par_idN105AC				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the default greeting to use if a personalized salutation cannot be created.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
