helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148391				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Use the Styles and Formatting window to apply, create, edit, add, and remove formatting styles. Double-click an entry to apply the style.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EF				0	gu	To \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"dock\"\>dock\</link\> the Styles and Formatting window, drag its title bar to the left or to the right side of the workspace. To undock the window, double-click a free space on its toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147167				0	gu	How to apply a style:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151264				0	gu	Select the text. To apply a Character Style to one word, click the word. To apply a Paragraph Style, click the paragraph.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150756				0	gu	Double-click the style in the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071D				0	gu	You can assign shortcut keys to Styles on the \<emph\>Tools - Customize - Keyboard\</emph\> tab page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154643				0	gu	The Styles and Formatting toolbar contains icons for formatting your documents:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154106				0	gu	Paragraph Styles 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149800				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ParaStyle\"\>Displays formatting styles for paragraphs.\</ahelp\> Use paragraph styles to apply the same \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#formatierung\" name=\"formatting\"\>formatting\</link\>, such as font, numbering, and layout to the paragraphs in your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150351				0	gu	Character Styles 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154570				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CharStyle\"\>Displays formatting styles for characters.\</ahelp\> Use character styles to apply font styles to selected text in a paragraph.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151332				0	gu	Frame Style 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143282				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FrameStyle\"\>Displays formatting styles for frames.\</ahelp\> Use frame styles to format frame layouts and position.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148976				0	gu	Page Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147220				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PageStyle\"\>Displays formatting styles for pages.\</ahelp\> Use page styles to determine page layouts, including the presence of headers and footers.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153361				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TemplateFamily5\"\>Displays formatting styles for numbered and bulleted lists.\</ahelp\> Use list styles to format number and bullet characters and to specify indents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
