helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3156277				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:LB_CHARSTYLE\"\>Specify the formatting style for the selected part on the \<emph\>Structure line\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
