helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	par_id3147176	5			0	gu	To create an index entry from a paragraph style, click the style in the\<emph\> Styles\</emph\> list, and then click the \<emph\>>> \</emph\>button to move the style to the index level that you want.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
