helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155919				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_DELETE\"\>Deletes the selected entry from the index. The entry text in the document is not deleted.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155869				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_PREV_SAME\"\>Jumps to the first index entry of the same type in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
