helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154327				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_PREV\"\>Jumps to the previous index entry of the same type in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148785				0	gu	\<image id=\"img_id3148791\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_prevrecord.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148791\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
