helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155620				0	gu	\<variable id=\"scripttext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertScript\"\>Inserts a script at the current cursor position in an HTML or text document.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150572				0	gu	If your document contains more than one script, the \<emph\>Edit Script\</emph\> dialog contains previous and next buttons to jump from script to script.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
