helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id0903200802541770				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a row into the table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
