helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3147490				0	gu	Inserts the comment as entered in the \<emph\>Description \</emph\>tab of the \<emph\>File Properties \</emph\>dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3145262				0	gu	Document number				2002-02-02 02:02:02
