helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149833				0	gu	Inserts the name of the author, and the date, or the time when the document was created.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3148856				0	gu	Info 0 - 3				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3154784				0	gu	Inserts the contents of the info fields found on the \<emph\>User Defined \</emph\>tab of the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01100300.xhp\" name=\"File - Properties\"\>\<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
