helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154642				0	gu	\<variable id=\"literaturvz\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertAuthoritiesEntry\"\>Inserts a bibliography reference.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157721				0	gu	From bibliography database				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154096				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AUTH_MARK_DLG_FROM_COMP_RB\"\>Inserts a reference from the bibliography database.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149805				0	gu	From document content				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153536				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AUTH_MARK_DLG_FROM_DOC_RB\"\>Inserts a reference from the bibliography records that are stored in the current document.\</ahelp\> An entry that is stored in the document has priority over an entry that is stored in the bibliography database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154200				0	gu	When you save a document that contains bibliography entries, the corresponding records are automatically saved in a hidden field in the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149490				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AUTH_MARK_DLG_ID_LISTBOX\"\>Select the short name of the bibliography record that you want to insert.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149824				0	gu	If available, the author and the full title of the selected short name are displayed in this area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147100				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_AUTH_MRK_OK\"\>Inserts the bibliographic reference into the document.\</ahelp\> If you created a new record, you must also insert it as an entry, otherwise the record is lost when you close the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149036				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_AUTH_MRK_CLOSE\"\>Closes the dialog.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147579				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_AUTH_MRK_CREATE_ENTRY\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120229.xhp\" name=\"Define Bibliography Entry\"\>Define Bibliography Entry\</link\> dialog, where you can create a new bibliography record. This record is only stored in the document. To add a record to the bibliography database, choose \<emph\>Tools - Bibliography Database\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3157900				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_AUTH_MRK_EDIT_ENTRY\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120229.xhp\" name=\"Define Bibliography Entry\"\>Define Bibliography Entry\</link\> dialog where you can edit the selected bibliography record.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
