helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151332				0	gu	Alphabetical numbering with identical capital letters, where the number of letters indicates the chapter level. For example, the second number in level three is "BBB".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149820				0	gu	Alphabetical numbering with identical lower case letters, where the number of letters indicates the chapter level. For example, the third number in level two is "cc".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148968				0	gu	No numbering symbol. Only the character or symbol defined in the \<emph\>Separator\</emph\> fields appears at the beginning of the numbered line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
