helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153351				0	gu	Displays all styles of the active style category.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150590				0	gu	Applied Style				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149168	24			0	gu	Displays the styles (of selected category) applied in the current document. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
