helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145780				0	gu	Displays all user-defined styles in the selected style category.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155908				0	gu	Character Styles 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150114				0	gu	Displays formatting styles for text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
