helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3147170				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies where footnotes and endnotes are displayed as well as their numbering formats.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154480				0	gu	Collect at end of text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
