helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153677				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_SECTION_FTNENDNOTES:CB_FTN_NUM\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Restarts the footnote numbering at the number that you specify.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
