helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154470				0	gu	Original Size				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155898				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_FRM_STD:BT_REALSIZE\"\>Resets the size settings of the selected object to the original values.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149102				0	gu	This option is not available for frames.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151262				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_FRM_STD:CB_AUTOHEIGHT\"\>Automatically adjusts the width or height of a frame to match the contents of the frame. If you want, you can specify a minimum width or minimum height for the frame.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152773				0	gu	The \<emph\>Automatic\</emph\> option is only available when you select a frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
