helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153352				0	gu	Specify the anchoring options for the selected object or frame. The anchor options are not available when you open the dialog from the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
