helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143275				0	gu	The \<emph\>Edit Sections\</emph\> dialog is similar to the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020100.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Section\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, and offers the following additional options:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149040				0	gu	The current write protection status of a section is indicated by the lock symbol in front of the section name in the list. An open lock is unprotected and a closed lock is protected. Similarly, visible sections are indicated by a glasses symbol.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153638				0	gu	Option				2002-02-02 02:02:02
