helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149351				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FOOTNOTE_PAGE\"\>Specifies the layout options for footnotes, including the line that separates the footnote from the main body of document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
