helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147514				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_FOOTNOTE_PAGE:RB_MAXHEIGHT_PAGE\"\>Automatically adjusts the height of the footnote area depending on the number of footnotes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154568				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_FOOTNOTE_PAGE:ED_MAXHEIGHT\"\>Enter the maximum height for the footnote area.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
