helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156048				0	gu	If the active cell is empty: selects the whole table. Otherwise: selects the contents of the active cell. Pressing again selects the entire table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
