helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154838				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Insert Rows\"\>Insert Rows\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147407				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertRows\"\>Inserts one or more rows in the table, below the selection. You can insert more than one row by opening the dialog (choose \<emph\>Table - Insert - Rows\</emph\>), or by selecting more than one row before clicking the icon.\</ahelp\> The second method inserts rows of the same height as the originally selected rows.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151180				0	gu	\<image id=\"img_id3151189\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertrows.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151189\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	gu	હરોળને ઉમેરો				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gu	સમય				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147174				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>time fields;inserting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fields;inserting time\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147174				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030200.xhp\" name=\"Time\"\>Time\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152896				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertTimeField\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Inserts the current time as a field.\</ahelp\> The time is taken directly from the system settings of your operating system. A fixed time format is applied, which cannot be updated by using the F9 function key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151177				0	gu	To assign a different time format, or adapt the actual time data, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and make the desired changes in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. Additionally, you can modify the format of an inserted time field at any time by choosing \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Fields\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04220000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151187				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/04220000.xhp\" name=\"Table: Fixed\"\>Table: Fixed\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151174				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TableModeFix\" visibility=\"visible\"\>If this mode is active, changes to a line and/or column affect only the neighboring lines or columns in question.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155896				0	gu	\<image src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_tablemodefix.png\" id=\"img_id3155903\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155903\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\08080000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gu	Combined Display				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\08080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151186				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/08080000.xhp\" name=\"Combined Display\"\>Combined Display\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\08080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151172				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:StatusBarFunc\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Displays current information about the active document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\08080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156375				0	gu	When the cursor is in a named section, the section name appears. When the cursor is in a table, the name of the table cell appears. The size of the object is shown when you edit frames or drawing objects.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\08080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145416				0	gu	When the cursor is positioned within text, you can double-click this field to open the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. In this dialog, you can define a field to be inserted in your document at the current cursor position. When the cursor is positioned in a table, a double-click in this field will call the \<emph\>Table Format\</emph\> dialog. Depending on the object selected, you can call up a dialog to edit a section, a graphic object, a floating frame, an OLE object, direct numbering or the position and size of a drawing object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\06090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154505				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/06090000.xhp\" name=\"Insert Unnumbered Entry\"\>Insert Unnumbered Entry\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147167				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>direct cursor; restriction\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147167				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18130000.xhp\" name=\"Direct Cursor On/Off\"\>Direct Cursor On/Off\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147508				0	gu	\<image id=\"img_id3154840\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_shadowcursor.png\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154840\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154570				0	gu	The direct cursor allows you to click in any blank area of a page to place text, images, tables, frames, and other objects.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902				0	gu	If you place the direct cursor approximately in the middle between the left and the right margin of a page or a table cell, the text you insert will be centered. Similarly, text is right-aligned when the direct cursor is placed on the right margin.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151255				0	gu	The AutoCorrect tool automatically removes empty paragraphs, tabs, and spaces that are inserted by the direct cursor. If you want to use the direct cursor, then disable the AutoCorrect tool.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148982				0	gu	The direct cursor sets tabs to position the cursor. If you change the tabs later. the position of the text on the page may change as well.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\19020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gu	ફુટર ઉમેરો				2002-02-02 02:02:02
