helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3153156				0	gu	In text documents, you can add continuously numbered captions to graphics, tables, frames, and drawing objects.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3153172				0	gu	You can edit the text and the number ranges for different types of captions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3153186				0	gu	When you add a caption to a picture or to an object, the object and the caption text are placed together in a new frame. When you add a caption to a table, the caption text is inserted as a paragraph next to the table. When you add a caption to a frame, the caption text is added to the text inside the frame, either before or after the existing text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_idN10713				0	gu	To move both the object and the caption, drag the frame that contains these items. To update the caption numbering after you move the frame, press F9.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3155586				0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Insert - File\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3147254				0	gu	You can edit caption text directly in the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3147271				0	gu	A caption is formatted with the paragraph style that matches the name of the caption \<emph\>Category\</emph\>. For example, if you insert a "Table" caption, the "Table" paragraph style is applied to the caption text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gu	Numbering and Numbering Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155174	30			0	gu	\<variable id=\"using_numbering\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/using_numbering.xhp\" name=\"Numbering and Numbering Styles\"\>Numbering and Numbering Styles\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149818				0	gu	You can apply numbering to a paragraph manually or with a paragraph style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3153405				0	gu	You cannot apply manual numbering to paragraphs that are listed under "Special Styles" in the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10711				0	gu	When you press Enter in a numbered or bulleted list, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> automatically numbers the next paragraph. To remove the numbering or bullet from the new paragraph, press Enter again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072B				0	gu	To change the hierarchical level of a bullet in a list, click in front of the paragraph, then press the Tab key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072F				0	gu	To change the bullets or numbering format for the current paragraph only, select a character or word in the paragraph, choose Bullets and Numbering, and then click a new format. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10733				0	gu	To change the bullet or numbering format for all paragraphs in the list, ensure that the cursor is in the list, choose Bullets and Numbering, and then click a new format. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	gu	To apply the same bullet or numbering format to all paragraphs in the list, select all paragraphs, choose Bullets and Numbering, and then click a format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073A				0	gu	You can also use the commands on the \<link href=\"text/swriter/main0206.xhp\" name=\"Numbering Object Bar\"\>Bullets and Numbering\</link\> toolbar to edit a numbered or bulleted list. To change the numbering or bullet format, click the \<emph\>Bullets and Numbering\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153123				0	gu	To apply numbering with a Paragraph Style				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3153137				0	gu	Paragraph Styles give you greater control over numbering that you apply in a document. When you change the numbering format of the style, all paragraphs using the style are automatically updated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149599				0	gu	Right-click the paragraph style that you want to apply numbering to, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149874				0	gu	In the \<emph\>Numbering Styles\</emph\> box, select the type of numbering that you want to use.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3145113				0	gu	Click \<emph\>Options\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149589				0	gu	Apply the style to the paragraphs that you want to add numbering to.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gu	Hiding Text				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148856	1			0	gu	\<variable id=\"hidden_text\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/hidden_text.xhp\" name=\"Hiding Text\"\>Hiding Text\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103				0	gu	You can use fields and sections to hide or display text in your document if a condition is met.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153409				0	gu	Before you can hide text, you must first create a variable to use in the condition for hiding the text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153131				0	gu	Click in your document and choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149640	21			0	gu	Click the \<emph\>Variables \</emph\>tab and click "Set Variable" in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149970	22			0	gu	Click "General" in the \<emph\>Format \</emph\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145108				0	gu	To hide the variable in your document, select \<emph\>Invisible\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156245				0	gu	To hide text:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145391				0	gu	Click in the document where you want to add the text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145409	5			0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other \</emph\>and click the \<emph\>Functions\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155325	29			0	gu	Click "Hidden Text" in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153371	31			0	gu	Type the text that you want to hide in the \<emph\>Hidden text \</emph\>box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154256				0	gu	To hide a paragraph:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154853				0	gu	Click in the paragraph where you want to add the text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154872	35			0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other \</emph\>and click the \<emph\>Functions\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902	6			0	gu	Click "Hidden Paragraph" in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148675				0	gu	To hide a section:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3148697				0	gu	Select the text that you want to hide in your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153019				0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Record\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3148603				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Fields - Other\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3147011				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Section\"\>Insert - Section\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
