helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155911				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>text; rotating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>rotating;text\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
