helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156104				0	gu	When a possible spelling error is encountered, the \<emph\>Spellcheck \</emph\>dialog opens and $[officename] offers some suggested corrections.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3145099				0	gu	To accept a correction, click the suggestion, and then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156241				0	gu	Edit the sentence in the upper text box, and then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3155886				0	gu	To add the unknown word to a user-defined dictionary, click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
