helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149281				0	gu	You can change a field to regular text, so that it is no longer updated. After you change a field to text, you cannot change the text back into a field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155608				0	gu	Select the field and choose \<emph\>Edit - Cut\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154238				0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste Special\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3157551				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/02070000.xhp\" name=\"Paste Special\"\>Paste Special\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3153786				0	gu	Place the cursor in the index or table of contents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
