helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065E				0	gu	Setting a document to register-true printing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10665				0	gu	Select the whole document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10669				0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Format - Page - Page\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10678				0	gu	All the paragraphs in the document will be printed register-true, unless otherwise specified.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067B				0	gu	Exempting paragraphs from register-true printing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10685				0	gu	Select all the paragraphs you want to exempt, then choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN1068C				0	gu	Open the Styles and Formatting window, click the Paragraph Style you want to exempt, right-click that style, choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>. In the dialog, click the \<emph\>Indents & Spacing\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10698				0	gu	Clear the \<emph\>Register-true\</emph\> checkbox.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
