helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149687				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>indexes;creating bibliographies\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>databases;creating bibliographies\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>bibliographies\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>entries;bibliographies\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>storing bibliographic information\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149687				0	gu	\<variable id=\"indices_literature\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/indices_literature.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Bibliography\"\>Creating a Bibliography\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3155864				0	gu	A bibliography is a list of works that you reference in a document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153402				0	gu	Storing Bibliographic Information				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414				0	gu	$[officename] stores bibliographic information in a bibliography database, or in an individual document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154244				0	gu	To store information in the bibliography database:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3155872				0	gu	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02250000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Bibliography Database\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Bibliography Database\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3155900				0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Record\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147123				0	gu	Type a name for the bibliography entry in the \<emph\>Short name \</emph\>box, and then add additional information to the record in the remaining boxes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150242				0	gu	To store bibliographic information in an individual document:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150964				0	gu	Choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120300.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Indexes and Tables - Bibliography Entry\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Bibliography Entry\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150525				0	gu	Select \<emph\>From document content\</emph\> and click \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153763				0	gu	Select the publication source for the record in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>box, and then add additional information in the remaining boxes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3146873				0	gu	Click \<emph\>Options\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150741				0	gu	Inserting Bibliography Entries From the Bibliography Database				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3148421				0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Bibliography Entry\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153231				0	gu	Select \<emph\>From bibliography database\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147085				0	gu	Click \<emph\>New\</emph\>, and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120300.xhp\" name=\"Bibliography Database\"\>Bibliography Database\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
