helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154377	64			0	gu	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>Table structure and contents, without formatting. With updating \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151093				0	gu	Drag-and-Drop a Cell Range From a Calc Spreadsheet				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150534				0	gu	Click and hold the mouse button in the selected cells.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
