helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_fromdraw.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414				0	gu	Open the document where you want to insert the object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_fromdraw.xhp	0	help	par_id3149640				0	gu	Open the Draw or Impress document containing the object that you want to copy.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
