helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3153902				0	gu	Double-click in front of the variable that you used to define the condition for hiding the text, and enter a different value for the variable.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3147114				0	gu	Double-click in front of the hidden text field or the hidden paragraph field, and change the condition statement.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
