helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3155918				0	gu	You can automatically number similar items, such as quotations, in your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	gu	Type the text that you want to assign numbering to, for example, "Quotation Number ".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3155886				0	gu	Click \<emph\>New\</emph\>, and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
