helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148701				0	gu	To apply a page style to a new page:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3147122				0	gu	Click in the document where you want a new page to start.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150210				0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Insert - File\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
