helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A3				0	gu	On the \<emph\>Tools\</emph\> bar, click the \<emph\>Direct Cursor\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3149846\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_shadowcursor.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149846\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
