helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\resize_navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3155916				0	gu	You can dock, undock and resize most $[officename] program windows such as the Navigator or the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\resize_navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3156096				0	gu	To resize the window, drag a corner or an edge of the window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
