helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150495				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>numbering; combining\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>merging;numbered lists\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>joining;numbered lists\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>lists;combining numbered lists\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paragraphs;numbering non-consecutive\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
