helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156021				0	gu	Locate the graphic file that you want to insert, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3153396				0	gu	By default, the inserted graphic is centered above the paragraph that you clicked in.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\nonprintable_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150224				0	gu	Enter text in the frame and if you want, resize the frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
