helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printer_tray.xhp	0	help	par_id3153140				0	gu	Click \<emph\>Options\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printer_tray.xhp	0	help	par_id3149649				0	gu	Repeat steps 1-5 for each page style that you want to specify the paper for.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
