helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3145808				0	gu	If you want to increase the spacing between footnote or endnote texts, you can add a top and bottom border to the corresponding paragraph style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
