helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150519				0	gu	In the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area, clear the \<emph\>Synchronize\</emph\> check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
