helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	gu	In this section you can delimit the number of approximation steps carried out during iterative calculations. In addition, you can specify the degree of precision of the answer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154142				0	gu	પુનરાવર્તન				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149795	6			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCPAGE_CALC:BTN_ITERATE\"\>Specifies whether formulas with iterative references (formulas that are continuously repeated until the problem is solved) are calculated after a specific number of repetitions.\</ahelp\> If the\<emph\> Iterations \</emph\>box is not marked, an iterative reference in the table will cause an error message.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156155				0	gu	Type the text 'Selling price' in cell A5, the text 'Net' in cell A6, and the text 'Value-added tax' in cell A7.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147530	61			0	gu	Now type a selling price (for example, 100) in cell B5. The net price should be shown in cell B6 and the value-added tax should be shown in cell B7. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153061				0	gu	You know that the value-added tax is calculated as 'net price times 15%' and that you arrive at the net price by deducting the value-added tax from the selling price. Type the formula \<item type=\"literal\"\>=B5-B7\</item\> in B6 to calculate the net price, and type the formula \<item type=\"literal\"\>=B6*0.15\</item\> in cell B7 to calculate the value-added tax.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154760				0	gu	Switch on the iterations to correctly calculate the formulas, otherwise a 'Circular reference' error message appears in the \<emph\>Status\</emph\> Bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
