helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gu	Security Level				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN10549				0	gu	\<variable id=\"macrosecurity_sl\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/macrosecurity_sl.xhp\"\>Security Level\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN10567				0	gu	Select the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/macrosecurity.xhp\"\>macro security\</link\> level from one of four options. The options differ according to the security level. Macros that are allowed to run on a higher security level are also allowed to run in all lower levels.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN10578				0	gu	Very high				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057C				0	gu	Only macros from trusted file locations are allowed to run. All other macros, regardless of whether they are signed or not, are disabled.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN10591				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Trusted file locations can be set on the Trusted Sources tab page. Any macro from a trusted file location is allowed to run.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A2				0	gu	High				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A6				0	gu	Only signed macros from trusted sources are allowed to run. Unsigned macros are disabled.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A9				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Trusted sources can be set on the Trusted Sources tab page. Only signed macros from a trusted source are allowed to run. In addition, any macro from a trusted file location is allowed to run.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BA				0	gu	મધ્યમ				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BE				0	gu	Confirmation required before executing macros from unknown sources.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C1				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Trusted sources can be set on the Trusted Sources tab page. Signed macros from a trusted source are allowed to run. In addition, any macro from a trusted file location is allowed to run. All other macros require your confirmation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D2				0	gu	Low (not recommended)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D6				0	gu	All macros will be executed without confirmation. Use this setting only if you are certain that all documents that will be opened are safe.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D9				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>A macro can be set to auto-start, and it can perform potentially damaging actions, as for example delete or rename files. This setting is not recommended when you open documents from other authors.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
