helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064B				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"703988739\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to save or send a document that contains recorded changes, versions, or notes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064E				0	gu	When printing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10652				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"703988740\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to print a document that contains recorded changes or notes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10655				0	gu	When signing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10659				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"703988741\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to sign a document that contains recorded changes, versions, fields, references to other sources (for example linked sections or linked pictures), or notes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065C				0	gu	When creating PDF files				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10660				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"703988742\"\>Select to see a warning dialog when you try to export a document to PDF format that displays recorded changes in Writer, or that displays notes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10663				0	gu	Remove personal information on saving				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_idN10667				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"703988743\"\>Select to always remove user data from the file properties. If this option is not selected, you can still remove the personal information for the current document with the \<emph\>Delete\</emph\> button on \<emph\>File - Properties - General\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
