helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154145				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_METRICFIELD_RID_SVXPAGE_GRID_MTR_FLD_SNAP_AREA\"\>Defines the snap distance between the mouse pointer and the object contour. $[officename] Impress snaps to a snap point if the mouse pointer is nearer than the distance selected in the \<emph\>Snap range \</emph\>spin box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150872				0	gu	સ્નેપ સ્થાન				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154639				0	gu	વસ્તુઓ બનાવતી અથવા ખસેડતી વખતે				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150417				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_GRID_CBX_ORTHO\"\>Specifies that graphic objects are restricted vertically, horizontally or diagonally (45°) when creating or moving them.\</ahelp\> You can temporarily deactivate this setting by pressing the Shift key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159345				0	gu	બાજુઓ વિસ્તૃત કરો				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154942	24			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_GRID_CBX_BIGORTHO\"\>Specifies that a square is created based on the longer side of a rectangle when the Shift key is pressed before you release the mouse button. This also applies to an ellipse (a circle will be created based on the longest diameter of the ellipse). When the\<emph\> Extend edges \</emph\>box is not marked, a square or a circle will be created based on the shorter side or diameter.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149413				0	gu	ફેરવતી વખતે				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154163				0	gu	બિંદુુ ઘટાડો				2002-02-02 02:02:02
