helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149416				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REDLINE_OPT\"\>Defines the appearance of changes in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	gu	લખાણ પ્રદર્શિત કરો				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3144510				0	gu	Defines the settings for displaying recorded changes. Select the type of change with the radio buttons, and the corresponding display attribute and color. The preview field shows the effect of the selected display options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148550				0	gu	Insertions / Attributes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_INS_ATTR\"\>Specifies how changes in the document are displayed when text is inserted.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152812				0	gu	Deletions / Attributes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_DEL_ATTR\"\>Specifies how changes in the document are displayed when text is deleted. If you record text deletions, the text is displayed with the selected attribute (for example, strikethrough) and is not deleted.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148674				0	gu	Changed attributes / Attributes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3151042				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_CHG_ATTR\"\>Defines how changes to text attributes are displayed in the document. These changes affect attributes such as bold, italic or underline.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
