helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149562				0	gu	To indicate which lines of the text have been changed, you can define a mark that appears in the left or right page margin.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145785				0	gu	Mark				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_REDLINE_OPT:LB_MARKPOS\"\>Defines if and where changed lines in the document are marked.\</ahelp\> You can set the markings so that they always appear on the left or right page margin, or on even or uneven pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
