helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154757				0	gu	The \<emph\>IgnoreAllList\</emph\> entry cannot be selected and cannot be deleted. Only the words included as content can be deleted. This happens automatically each time that $[officename] is closed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
