helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151130				0	gu	Specifies that you will never be asked for a manual hyphenation. If the field is not marked, when a word is not recognized you will be presented with a dialog for entering hyphens.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
