helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148538				0	gu	Display Grid				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILEDLG_STANDARD\"\>Displays the files and directories in the directory that you are in.\</ahelp\> To open a file, select the file, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154514				0	gu	Click a column header to sort the files. Click again to reverse the sort order.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
