helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010601.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057B				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Automatically adds the reverse mapping direction to the list for each modification that you enter.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
