helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	par_id3143225				0	gu	In \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>, a date with the value "0" corresponds to Dec 30, 1899.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155870				0	gu	Time Formats				2002-02-02 02:02:02
