helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149119				0	gu	\<variable id=\"litdattext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"HID_BIB_DB_TBX\"\>Insert, delete, edit, and organize records in the bibliography database.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	gu	If the fields in your database are read-only, ensure that the data source view is closed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150506				0	gu	The supplied bibliography database contains sample records of books about $[officename].				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155356				0	gu	Use the toolbar to select a table in the bibliography database, to search for records, or to sort the records using filters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150868				0	gu	Inserting a New Record				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149168	6			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GRID_TRAVEL_NEW\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a new record into the current table.\</ahelp\>To create a record, click the asterisk (*) button at the bottom of the table view. An empty row is added at the end of the table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163716				0	gu	Finding and Filtering Records				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147478				0	gu	You can search for records by matching a keyword to a field entry.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159181				0	gu	Entering Search key				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159125	11			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Bib/query\"\>Type the information that you want to search for, and then press Enter. To change the filter options for the search, long-click the \<emph\>AutoFilter\</emph\> icon, and then select a different data field. You can use wildcards such as % or * for any number of characters, and _ or ? for one character in your search. To display all of the records in the table, clear this box, and then press Enter. \</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155511				0	gu	AutoFilter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Bib/autoFilter\"\>Long-click to select the data field that you want to search using the term that you entered in the \<emph\>Search Key\</emph\> box. You can only search one data field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	gu	The list of table records is automatically updated to match the new filter settings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147580				0	gu	Deleting a Record				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154471				0	gu	To delete a record in the current table, right-click the row header of the record, and then select \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>. \<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_DELETEROWS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the selected record.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152941				0	gu	Changing the data source				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151118				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Bib/sdbsource\"\>Select the data source for the bibliography database.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145645				0	gu	Column Arrangement				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151282	36			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Bib/Mapping\"\>Lets you map the column headings to data fields from a different data source. To define a different data source for your bibliography, click the\<emph\> Data Source\</emph\> button on the record\<emph\> Object Bar\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144767				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"BIB_LISTBOX_RID_DLG_MAPPING_LB_CUSTOM4\"\>Select the data field that you want to map to the current \<emph\>Column name\</emph\>. To change the available data fields, select a different data source for your bibliography.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
