helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN10584				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Translates simplified Chinese text characters to traditional Chinese text characters. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to translate the selected text. If no text is selected, the whole document is translated.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
