helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152551				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_NUMERICFIELD_RID_SVXDLG_SEARCHSIMILARITY_NF_OTHER\"\>Enter the number of characters in the search term that can be exchanged.\</ahelp\> For example, if you specify 2 exchanged characters, "black" and "crack" are considered similar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
