helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152463				0	gu	Cutting, copying and pasting data				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149287				0	gu	You can cut, copy, and paste table fields in \<emph\>Data Source\</emph\> view. The Data Source browser also supports the dragging and dropping of table fields, or simple text and numbers from other $[officename] files.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
