helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	gu	The wizard saves the current settings and goes to the next page. Once you reach the last page, this button will become inactive.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346	10			0	gu	According to your selections, the wizard creates a document template and saves it on your hard disk. A new document based on the template appears in the work area, with the filename "UntitledX" (X stands for an automatic number).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149235				0	gu	$[officename] saves the current settings in the wizard according to the selected document template. These will be used as the default settings the next time you activate the wizard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
