helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050500.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gu	Presentation Wizard Page 5				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247				0	gu	You can determine which pages to include in the created presentation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150178				0	gu	Choose your pages				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552				0	gu	In the list field, you see all pages belonging to the selected presentation template. All pages with a checkmark in the check box next to their names will be included in the created presentation. To not include a page, clear the check box in front of the page name. Click the small plus sign that is next to the page name to display the corresponding sub-items.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149346				0	gu	Create summary				2002-02-02 02:02:02
