helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149748				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/20040000.xhp\" name=\"Insert Mode\"\>Insert Mode\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363	2			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertMode\"\>Displays the current insert mode. You can toggle between INSRT = insert and OVER = overwrite.\</ahelp\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>This field is only active if the cursor is in the input line of the formula bar or in a cell.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	gu	\<emph\>Task\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155391				0	gu	\<emph\>Result\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149388				0	gu	INSRT				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147243				0	gu	In the insert mode, new text is inserted at the cursor position and the following text is shifted to the right. The cursor is displayed as a vertical line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148539				0	gu	OVER				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156327				0	gu	In the overwrite mode, any existing text is replaced by new text. The cursor is displayed as a thick vertical line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01171300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151262				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01171300.xhp\" name=\"Snap to Grid\"\>Snap to Grid\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
