helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\blockarrows.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056A				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Block Arrows toolbar from which you can insert graphics into your document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\blockarrows.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059D				0	gu	Some shapes have a handle which you can drag to change the properties of the shape. The mouse pointer changes to a hand symbol over these special handles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
