helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14070000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149991				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>SQL; DISTINCT parameter\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>distinct values in SQL queries\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
