helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143				0	gu	Set left indent				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307				0	gu	Drag the bottom left mark to the right while pressing the mouse button				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155449				0	gu	Set left indent of first line				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673				0	gu	Drag the top left mark to the right while pressing the mouse button				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156156				0	gu	Set right indent				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153761				0	gu	Drag the mark on the right to the left while pressing the mouse button				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154760				0	gu	In order to change the left indent starting with the second line of a paragraph, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key, click the triangle on the bottom left, and drag it to the right.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148453				0	gu	Tabs that have been set are not changed when indenting a paragraph. If the set tabs end up outside the margins of the paragraph, they are no longer displayed, but they still exist.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gu	ફોર્મ શોધક				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143284				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>controls;arranging in forms\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>forms;Navigator\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Form Navigator\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>subforms; creating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>controls; hidden\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hidden controls in Form Navigator\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143284				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigator\"\>Form Navigator\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowFmExplorer\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\>. The \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> displays all forms and subforms of the current document with their respective controls.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147399				0	gu	When using several forms, the Form Navigator gives an overview of all forms, and also provides various functions for editing them.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FORM_NAVIGATOR\"\>The \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> contains a list of all created (logical) forms with the corresponding control fields.\</ahelp\> You can see whether a form contains control fields by the plus sign displayed before the entry. Click the plus sign to open the list of the form elements.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	gu	To edit the name in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\>, click on the name and enter a new name, or use the command in the context menu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156347				0	gu	If you select a control in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\>, the corresponding element is selected in the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153662				0	gu	If you call the context menu of a selected entry, the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> offers the following functions:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153252				0	gu	નવું				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561	8			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NEW\"\>Adds new elements to the form. The\<emph\> Add \</emph\>function can only be called if a form is selected in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156117	10			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NEW_FORM\"\>Creates a new form in the document. \</ahelp\> To create a \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"subform\"\>subform\</link\> add the new form under the desired parent form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155342				0	gu	Hidden Controls				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NEW_HIDDEN\"\>Creates a hidden control in the selected form that is not visible on screen and is hidden from the user. A hidden control serves to include data that is transmitted together with the form.\</ahelp\> It contains additional information or clarifying text that you can specify when creating the form through the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Special Properties\"\>Special Properties\</link\> of the control. Select the entry of the hidden control in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> and select the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> command.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3159147				0	gu	You can copy controls in the document through the clipboard (shortcut keys \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C for copying and \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+V for inserting). You can copy hidden controls in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> by using drag-and-drop while keeping the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key pressed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152812				0	gu	દૂર કરો				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_DELETE\"\>Deletes the selected entry.\</ahelp\> This allows you to delete individual form components as well as whole forms with one mouse click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153799				0	gu	ટેબનો ક્રમાંક				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156282				0	gu	When a form is selected, it opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170300.xhp\" name=\"Tab Order\"\>\<emph\>Tab Order\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, where the indices for focusing the control elements on the Tab key are defined.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150869				0	gu	ફરીનામ				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3145607				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_RENAME_OBJECT\"\>Renames the selected object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149766				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowPropertyBrowser\"\>Starts the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog for the selected entry.\</ahelp\> If a form is selected, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170200.xhp\" name=\"Form Properties\"\>Form Properties\</link\> dialog opens. If a control is selected, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170100.xhp\" name=\"Control Properties\"\>Control Properties\</link\> dialog opens.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
