helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10617				0	gu	Click the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3610034\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formatpaintbrush.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3610034\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
