helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070300.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143284				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>database contents; inserting as text\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3143284	3			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:RB_AS_TEXT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts data selected from the data source browser into the document as text.\</ahelp\>If you select the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> option in the \<emph\>Insert Database Columns\</emph\> dialog, the content of the data selected in the data source browser is inserted into the document as text. In the dialog, you can decide which database fields or columns are transferred, and how the text is formatted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154289				0	gu	If several records are selected when you choose the \<emph\>Data to Text\</emph\> function, the mail merge fields will be inserted according to the number of records.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155392				0	gu	લખાણ:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	gu	In the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> area, use the arrow button to select the database table columns into which you want to insert field contents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148643				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>controls; events\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>events; controls\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>macros; assigning to events in forms\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148643				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170103.xhp\" name=\"Events\"\>Events\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152350	2			0	gu	On the\<emph\> Events \</emph\>tab page you can link macros to events that occur in a form's control fields.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	gu	When the event occurs, the linked macro will be called. To assign a macro to an event, press the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button. An \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05060700.xhp\" name=\"Assign Macro\"\>Assign Macro\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>dialog\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> opens.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149732				0	gu	Depending on the control, different events are available. Only the available events for the selected control and context are listed on the \<emph\>Events\</emph\> tab page. The following events are defined:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVEACTIONPERFORMED\"\>This event takes place before an action is triggered by clicking the control.\</ahelp\> For example,clicking a "Submit" button initiates a send action; however, the actual "send" process is started only when the \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> event occurs. The \<emph\>Before commencing\</emph\> event allows you to kill the process. If the linked method sends back FALSE, \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> will not be executed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ACTIONPERFORMED\"\>The\<emph\> When initiating \</emph\>event occurs when an action is started.\</ahelp\> For example, if you have a "Submit" button in your form, the send process represents the action to be initiated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156343				0	gu	બદલાયેલુ				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148755	42			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_CHANGED\"\>The\<emph\> Changed \</emph\>event takes place when the control loses the focus and the content of the control has changed since it lost the focus.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153524				0	gu	બદલાયેલુ લખાણ				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150495	11			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_TEXTCHANGED\"\>The\<emph\> Text modified \</emph\>event takes place if you enter or modify a text in an input field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154123				0	gu	વસ્તુ સ્થિતિ બદલાઈ ગઈ				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870	9			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ITEMSTATECHANGED\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The\<emph\> Item status changed \</emph\>event takes place if the status of the control field has changed.\</ahelp\>The\<emph\> Item status changed\</emph\> event takes place if he status of the control field has changed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151176				0	gu	જ્યારે ફોકસ મેળવો ત્યારે				2002-02-02 02:02:02
