helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148618	27			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEENTERED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse inside \</emph\>event takes place if the mouse is inside the control field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
