helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829	2			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Saves the current database table record.\</ahelp\> The\<emph\> Save Record \</emph\>icon is found on the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0212.xhp\" name=\"Database Bar\"\>Table Data bar\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
