helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760	3			0	gu	You can insert the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#hyperlink\" name=\"hyperlink\"\>hyperlink\</link\> as text or as a button. Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Hyperlink\</emph\> icon, then select \<emph\>As text\</emph\> or \<emph\>As button \</emph\>from the menu. The hyperlink is then inserted at the current cursor location.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
