helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233	2			0	gu	This \<emph\>General \</emph\>tab enables you to define the general properties of a form control. These properties differ, depending on the control type. Not all of the following properties are available for every control.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
