helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MN_READONLY_COPYGRAPHIC\"\>Copies a selected graphic to the clipboard.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145629	22			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MN_READONLY_LOADGRAPHIC\"\>If you have deactivated the graphics display, choose the\<emph\> Load Graphics \</emph\>command to make them visible.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
