helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283				0	gu	The width of a data field in the exported text file is set to the current width of the corresponding column.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3154116				0	gu	Values are exported in the format as currently seen in the cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3156414				0	gu	If a value is longer than the fixed column width, it will be exported as a ### string.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3150178				0	gu	If a text string is longer than the fixed column width, it will be truncated at the end.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
