helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3153838				0	gu	Starts with the Impress file \<emph\>{filename.odp}\</emph\> and starts the presentation. Enters edit mode after the presentation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
