helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155555				0	gu	\<variable id=\"chart_axis\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/chart_axis.xhp\" name=\"Editing Chart Axes\"\>Editing Chart Axes\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	gu	To edit the axes of a chart that you have inserted:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Format - Axis\</emph\>, then select the axis (or axes) that you would like to edit. A dialog appears.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	gu	Select from the available sections and make the required changes (for example, select the \<emph\>Scale\</emph\> tab if you want to modify the scale of the axis).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/schart/01/05010000.xhp\" name=\"Format - Object Properties\"\>Format - Object Properties\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
