helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153825				0	gu	\<variable id=\"linestyle_define\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/linestyle_define.xhp\" name=\"Defining Line Styles\"\>Defining Line Styles\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
