helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3155449				0	gu	Specify the line options that you want.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\linestyle_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	gu	To specify the length of the line as a percentage of the line width, select \<emph\>Fit to line width\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
