helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CD				0	gu	Clear the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> text box if necessary.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	gu	Click \<emph\>Attributes\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DD				0	gu	In the \<emph\>Attributes\</emph\> dialog, select the \<emph\>Font\</emph\> check box, and click OK.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E8				0	gu	In the \<emph\>Find & Replace\</emph\> dialog, you now can read "Font" below the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> text box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F4				0	gu	Click \<emph\>Find\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FB				0	gu	All places where a font change was applied, either directly or by assigning an appropriate style, are found.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
