helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148534				0	gu	You can move the anchor of an object with the arrow keys. First enter the handle edit mode and select the anchor. Depending on the type of anchor, you can then move the anchor in different directions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
