helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153919				0	gu	Use the arrow keys to move the anchor. The object follows the anchor as appropriate.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3152582				0	gu	You can change the anchor of the selected object for example in the object's context menu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
