helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	gu	Copies the selected row to the clipboard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152472				0	gu	Pastes the content of the clipboard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
