helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_RADIOBUTTON_DLG_REL_PROPERTIES_RB_CASC_UPD_NULL\"\> If the corresponding primary key has been modified, use this option to set the "IS NULL" value to all external key fields. IS NULL means that the field is empty.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150448				0	gu	Set default				2002-02-02 02:02:02
