helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN10594				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Only allows characters that conform to the SQL92 naming convention in a name in a data source. All other characters are rejected. Each name must begin with a lowercase letter, an uppercase letter, or an underscore ( _ ). The remaining characters can be ASCII letters, numbers, and underscores.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
