helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145584				0	gu	If you select "Macromedia Flash (SWF)" as file format, the current Impress or Draw document will be exported to the Macromedia Flash format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
