helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\11100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:OutlineFormat\"\>Shows or hides the character formatting of the slide headings. To change the character formatting of a heading, open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window, right-click a style, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
