helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146963				0	gu	Draws a filled oval where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the oval, and drag to the size you want. To draw a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
