helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	gu	\<image id=\"img_id3150990\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_circle_unfilled.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150990\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
