helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147405				0	gu	Draws a filled rectangle where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the rectangle, and drag to the size you want. To draw a square, hold down Shift while you drag.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145164				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Square\"\>Draws a filled square where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the square, and drag to the size you want. To draw a rectangle, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145355				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Rect_Rounded\"\>Draws a rounded rectangle with a fill where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the rounded rectangle, and drag to the size you want. To draw a rounded square, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149715				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Square_Rounded\"\>Draws a rounded square with a fill where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the rounded square, and drag to the size you want. To draw a rounded rectangle, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149981				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Rect_Unfilled\"\>Draws an empty rectangle where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the rectangle, and drag to the size you want. To draw a square, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148830				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Square_Unfilled\"\>Draws an empty square where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the square, and drag to the size you want. To draw a rectangle, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
