helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150990				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Square_Rounded_Unfilled\"\>Draws an empty rounded square where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the rounded square, and drag to the size you want. To draw a rounded rectangle, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
