helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\print_tofit.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155067				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>fitting to pages; individual slides\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pages; fitting to printed pages\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing; fitting to paper\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\print_tofit.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155067				0	gu	\<variable id=\"print_tofit\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/print_tofit.xhp\" name=\"Printing a Slide to Fit a Paper Size\"\>Printing a Slide to Fit a Paper Size\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\print_tofit.xhp	0	help	par_id3154704				0	gu	You can reduce the size of a slide when you print, so that the slide can fit on a printed page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\print_tofit.xhp	0	help	par_id3154658				0	gu	Open the document that you want to print.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\print_tofit.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	gu	In \<emph\>Normal View\</emph\>, choose \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Page\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\print_tofit.xhp	0	help	par_id3148871	6			0	gu	In \<emph\>Layout settings \</emph\>area, select the \<emph\>Fit object to paper format\</emph\> check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\print_tofit.xhp	0	help	par_id3153811				0	gu	In the \<emph\>Paper format\</emph\> area, select a \<emph\>Format\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\print_tofit.xhp	0	help	par_id3150431				0	gu	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The slide is resized to fit the printed page, while maintaining the relative positions of the objects on the slide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gu	Loading Line and Arrow Styles				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145253				0	gu	\<variable id=\"line_arrow_styles\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/line_arrow_styles.xhp\" name=\"Loading Line and Arrow Styles\"\>Loading Line and Arrow Styles\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017				0	gu	You can use styles to organize similar line and arrow types. $[officename] provides a few standard style files that you can load and use in your document. If you want, you can add or delete elements from a style file, or even create a custom style file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154485				0	gu	To load a line styles file:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382				0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Format - Line\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Line Styles\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154705				0	gu	Click the \<emph\>Load Line Styles\</emph\> button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3151240				0	gu	To save a line styles file, click the \<emph\>Save Line Styles\</emph\> button, enter a filename, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154765				0	gu	To load an arrow styles file:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153070				0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Format - Line\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Arrow Styles\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149054				0	gu	Click the \<emph\>Load Arrow Styles\</emph\> button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3166465				0	gu	To save a line styles file, click the \<emph\>Save Arrow Styles\</emph\> button, enter a filename, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3145822				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05200000.xhp\" name=\"Format - Line\"\>Format - Line\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
