helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3148870				0	gu	To resize the spreadsheet without resizing the cells, double-click the spreadsheet, and then drag a corner handle. To resize the cells of the spreadsheet, click the spreadsheet, and then drag a corner handle.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154765				0	gu	When you insert an existing spreadsheet into your slide, changes that are made to the original spreadsheet file are not updated on your slide. You can, however, make changes to the spreadsheet in your slide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
