helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150344				0	gu	You can create custom slide shows to meet the needs of your audience using slides within the current presentation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150715				0	gu	To create a custom slide show:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
