helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3153966	62			0	gu	Click \<emph\>New\</emph\> and enter a name for your slide show in the \<emph\>Name \</emph\>box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150249				0	gu	Under \<emph\>Existing Slides\</emph\>, select the slides you want to add to your slide show, and click the \<emph\>>>\</emph\> button. Hold down Shift to select a range of slides, or Ctrl to select multiple slides.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3153916				0	gu	You can change the order of the slides in your custom slide show, by dragging and dropping the slides under \<emph\>Selected Slides\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151387				0	gu	To start a custom slide show:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3147403				0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Custom Slide Show\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150538				0	gu	Select the show you want to start from the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3149943				0	gu	Click \<emph\>Start\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3145593	56			0	gu	If you want the selected custom slide show to start when you click the \<emph\>Slide Show\</emph\> icon on the\<emph\> Presentation\</emph\> toolbar, or when you press F5, select \<emph\>Use Custom Slide Show\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
