helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150011				0	gu	\<variable id=\"nameneinfuegentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertName\"\>Inserts a defined named cell range at the current cursor's position.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149412				0	gu	You can only insert a cell area after having defined a name for the area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153160				0	gu	Insert name 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154944				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:RID_SCDLG_NAMES_PASTE:LB_ENTRYLIST\"\>Lists all defined cell areas. Double-click an entry to insert the named area into the active sheet at the current cursor position.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
