helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	gu	The \<emph\>Format Cells\</emph\> dialog appears with the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> tab page open.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153094				0	gu	Hyphenation for Drawing Objects				2002-02-02 02:02:02
