helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3145256				0	gu	PV (optional): the (present) cash value of an investment.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150999				0	gu	Type (optional): defines whether the payment is due at the beginning or the end of a period.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
