helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153487				0	gu	Examples 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153811				0	gu	DAYSINYEAR(A1) returns 366 days if A1 contains 2/29/68, a valid date for the year 1968.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154737				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>EXPONDIST function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>exponential distributions\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
