helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149591				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DBSUMME\"\>DSUM returns the total of all cells in a database field in all rows (records) that match the specified search criteria.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
