helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknumadd.xhp	0	help	par_id3159277				0	gu	\<emph\>Date\</emph\>: the date within the calendar week.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknumadd.xhp	0	help	par_id3154098				0	gu	\<emph\>Return type\</emph\>: 1 for week beginning on a Sunday, 2 for week beginning on a Monday.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
