helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153289				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_BASIS\"\>Converts a positive integer to a specified base into a text from the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#zahlensystem\" name=\"numbering system\"\>numbering system\</link\>.\</ahelp\> The digits 0-9 and the letters A-Z are used.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
