helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148746	219			0	gu	\<emph\>Minimum length\</emph\> (optional) determines the minimum length of the character sequence that has been created. If the text is shorter than the indicated minimum length, zeros are added to the left of the string.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
