helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154338				0	gu	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\>: the annual nominal rate of interest (coupon interest rate)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3148466				0	gu	\<emph\>Yield\</emph\>: the annual yield of the security.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149423				0	gu	\<emph\>P\</emph\> is the number of interest payment periods per year.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
