helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149627				0	gu	Price: the price (purchase price) of the treasury bill per 100 currency units of par value.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149642				0	gu	Examples 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145178				0	gu	Settlement date: March 31 1999, maturity date: June 1 1999, price: 98.45 currency units.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145193				0	gu	The yield of the treasury bill is worked out as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3148528				0	gu	=TBILLYIELD("3/31/99";"6/1/99"; 98.45) returns 0.091417 or 9.1417 per cent.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
