helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3147412	7			0	gu	\<emph\>Data_X\</emph\> is the independent set of observations or data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3152983				0	gu	Names, arrays or references containing numbers must be used here. Numbers can also be entered directly.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
