helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3148728				0	gu	To calculate the intercept, use cells D3:D9 as the y value and C3:C9 as the x value from the example spreadsheet. Input will be as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
