helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3155827	17			0	gu	\<emph\>Value1; value2, ...\</emph\> are 1 to 30 values or ranges representing the values to be counted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149254				0	gu	Examples 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
