helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_SUBT_GROUP1\"\>Specify the settings for up to three subtotal groups. Each tab has the same layout.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	gu	To insert subtotal values into a table:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
