helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A5				0	gu	Allow only values that are given in a cell range. The cell range can be specified explicitly, or as a named database range, or as a named range. The range may consist of one column or one row of cells. If you specify a range of columns and rows, only the first column is used.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
