helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B0				0	gu	Allow only values or strings specified in a list. Strings and values can be mixed. Numbers evaluate to their value, so if you enter the number 1 in the list, the entry 100% is also valid.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
