helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3149819	92			0	gu	GEOMEAN(23; 46; 69) = 41.79. The geometric mean value of this random sample is therefore 41.79.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
