helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150448				0	gu	Set the filtering options for the data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151043				0	gu	Filter Criteria				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150440				0	gu	You can define a default filter for the data by filtering, for example, field names, using a combination of logical expressions arguments.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
