helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3149946	33			0	gu	AVEDEV(Number 1; Number 2; ...Number 30)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3157904	34			0	gu	\<emph\>Number 1, number 2, ... number 30\</emph\> are numerical values or ranges representing a sample based on an entire population.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
