helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149734				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>EXPONDIST function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>exponential distributions\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
