helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3150424	151			0	gu	=PERMUT(6; 3) returns 120. There are 120 different possibilities, to pick a sequence of 3 playing cards out of 6 playing cards.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143276				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>PERMUTATIONA function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
