helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147428				0	gu	You cannot sort data if the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02230000.xhp\" name=\"Record changes\"\>Record changes\</link\> options is enabled.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
