helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147363				0	gu	The cells for the 1st and 2nd quarters each contain a sum formula for the three cells to their left. If you apply the \<emph\>AutoOutline\</emph\> command, the table is grouped into two quarters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146918				0	gu	To remove the outline, select the table, and then choose \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12080600.xhp\" name=\"Data - Outline - Remove\"\>Data - Outline - Remove\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
