helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D1				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"26275\"\>Inserts a sheet from a different spreadsheet file.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F7				0	gu	Use the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01020000.xhp\"\>file open\</link\> dialog to locate the spreadsheet.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10609				0	gu	In the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04050000.xhp\"\>Insert Sheet\</link\> dialog, select the sheet that you want to insert.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140100.xhp\" name=\"Down\"\>Down\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153969				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillDown\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two rows with the contents of the top cell of the range.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145787				0	gu	If a selected range has only one column, the contents of the top cell are copied to all others. If several columns are selected, the contents of the corresponding top cell will be copied down.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04010100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153821				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>sheets; inserting row breaks\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>row breaks; inserting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserting; manual row breaks\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>manual row breaks\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153821				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04010100.xhp\" name=\"Row Break\"\>Row Break\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertRowBreak\"\>Inserts a row break (horizontal page break) above the selected cell.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	gu	The manual row break is indicated by a dark blue horizontal line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
