helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	gu	Use the Styles and Formatting window to assign styles to objects and text sections. You can update Styles, modify existing Styles or create new Styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
