helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131				0	gu	To show a column or row, select the range of rows or columns containing the hidden elements, then choose \<emph\>Format - Row - Show\</emph\> or \<emph\>Format - Column - Show\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
