helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_id3147229	20			0	gu	$[officename] automatically adds a caption to buttons that are dragged into the \<emph\>Data Fields \</emph\>area. The caption contains the name of the data field as well as the formula that created the data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_id3145749				0	gu	To change the function that is used by a data field, double-click a button in the \<emph\>Data Fields\</emph\> area to open the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090105.xhp\" name=\"Data Field\"\>Data Field\</link\> dialog. You can also double-click buttons in the \<emph\>Row Fields\</emph\> or \<emph\>Column Fields\</emph\> areas.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
