helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153361				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillRight\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two columns with the contents of the left most cell.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684				0	gu	If a range of only one row is selected, the contents of the far left cell are copied to all the other selected cells. If you have selected several rows, each of the far left cells is copied into those cells to the right.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
