helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150363				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MAXA\"\>Returns the maximum value in a list of arguments. In opposite to MAX, here you can enter text. The value of the text is 0.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
