helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3149941				0	gu	=CORREL(A1:A50; B1:B50) calculates the correlation coefficient as a measure of the linear correlation of the two data sets.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
