helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149020				0	gu	Contains row labels				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154754				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_COLROWNAMERANGES:BTN_ROWHEAD\"\>Includes row labels in the current label range.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159264				0	gu	For data range				2002-02-02 02:02:02
