helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	gu	Lists the name of the selected data field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F0				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Expands or reduces the dialog. The \<emph\>More\</emph\> button is visible for data fields only.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F7				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090106.xhp\"\>Data Field Options\</link\> dialog. The \<emph\>Options\</emph\> button is visible for column, row, or page fields only.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10708				0	gu	If the dialog is expanded by the \<emph\>More\</emph\> button, the following items are added to the dialog:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070F				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>For each data field, you can select the type of display.\</ahelp\> For some types you can select additional information for a base field and a base item.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10716				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"1495371266\"\>Select the type of calculating of the displayed value for the data field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10731				0	gu	Normal				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	gu	Results are shown unchanged				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073E				0	gu	Difference from				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10744				0	gu	From each result, its reference value (see below) is subtracted, and the difference is shown. Totals outside of the base field are shown as empty results.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10747				0	gu	\<emph\>Named item\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074C				0	gu	If a base item name is specified, the reference value for a combination of field items is the result where the item in the base field is replaced by the specified base item.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074F				0	gu	\<emph\>Previous item or Next item\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10754				0	gu	If "previous item" or "next item" is specified as the base item, the reference value is the result for the next visible member of the base field, in the base field's sort order.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075B				0	gu	% Of				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10761				0	gu	Each result is divided by its reference value. The reference value is determined in the same way as for "Difference from". Totals outside of the base field are shown as empty results. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1076A				0	gu	% Difference from				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10770				0	gu	From each result, its reference value is subtracted, and the difference is divided by the reference value. The reference value is determined in the same way as for "Difference from". Totals outside of the base field are shown as empty results.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10777				0	gu	Running total in				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077D				0	gu	Each result is added to the sum of the results for preceding items in the base field, in the base field's sort order, and the total sum is shown.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10780				0	gu	Results are always summed, even if a different summary function was used to get each result.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10787				0	gu	% of row				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10794				0	gu	% of column				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079A				0	gu	Same as "% of row", but the total for the result's column is used.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A1				0	gu	% of total				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A7				0	gu	Same as "% of row", but the grand total for the result's data field is used.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AE				0	gu	Index				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B4				0	gu	The row and column totals and the grand total, following the same rules as above, are used to calculate the following expression:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B7				0	gu	( original result * grand total ) / ( row total * column total )				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107BA				0	gu	Base field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
