helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153366				0	gu	AMORDEGRC				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_AMORDEGRC\"\>Calculates the amount of depreciation for a settlement period as degressive amortization.\</ahelp\> Unlike AMORLINC, a depreciation coefficient that is independent of the depreciable life is used here.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147427				0	gu	AMORDEGRC(Cost;Date purchased;First period;Salvage;Period;Rate;Basis)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3156286	366			0	gu	\<emph\>Salvage\</emph\> is the value of an asset at the end of the depreciation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155064	368			0	gu	\<emph\>number\</emph\> is the number of repetitions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
