helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3166423				0	gu	Defines the order in which data in a sheet is numbered and printed when it does not fit on one printed page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152580				0	gu	Top to bottom, then right				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150205				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCPAGE_TABLE:BTN_TOPDOWN\"\>Prints vertically from the left column to the bottom of the sheet.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
