helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271				0	gu	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Navigator\</emph\> to display the Navigator.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149958				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_NAVIPI_ROW\"\>Enter a row number in the\<emph\> Row \</emph\>spin box. Press Enter to reposition the cell cursor to the specified row in the same column.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150717				0	gu	Data range				2002-02-02 02:02:02
