helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150086				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_NAVIPI_UP\"\>Moves to the cell at the beginning of the current data range, which you can highlight using the \<emph\>Data Range\</emph\> button.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
