helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159098				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_NAVIPI_ROOT\"\>Toggles the content view. Only the selected Navigator element and its subelements are displayed.\</ahelp\> Click the icon again to restore all elements for viewing.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
