helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gu	Shortcut Keys for Spreadsheets				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145801				0	gu	\<variable id=\"calc_keys\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/04/01020000.xhp\" name=\"Shortcut Keys for Spreadsheets\"\>Shortcut Keys for Spreadsheets\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155067				0	gu	To fill a selected cell range with the formula that you entered on the \<emph\>Input line\</emph\>, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter. Hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter+Shift to apply the cell format of the input cell to the entire cell range.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153967				0	gu	To create a matrix in which all the cells contain the same information as what you entered on the \<emph\>Input line\</emph\>, press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter. You cannot edit the components of the matrix.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166426				0	gu	To select multiple cells in different areas of a sheet, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and drag in the different areas.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150207				0	gu	To select multiple sheets in a spreadsheet, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then click the name tabs at the lower edge of the workspace. To select only one sheet in a selection, hold down Shift, and then click the name tab of the sheet.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166432				0	gu	To insert a manual line break in a cell, click in the cell, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146978				0	gu	To delete the contents of selected cells, press Delete. This opens the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02150000.xhp\" name=\"Delete Contents\"\>Delete Contents\</link\> dialog, where you choose which contents of the cell you want to delete. To delete the contents of selected cells without a dialog, press the Backspace key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145386				0	gu	Navigating in Spreadsheets				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146871				0	gu	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + Home				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159093				0	gu	Moves the cursor to the first cell in the sheet (A1).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145073				0	gu	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + End				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153283				0	gu	Moves the cursor to the last cell on the sheet that contains data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159205				0	gu	Moves the cursor to the first cell of the current row.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155095				0	gu	Moves the cursor to the last cell of the current row.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143220				0	gu	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + Left Arrow				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154766				0	gu	Moves the cursor to the left edge of the current data range. If the column to the left of the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves to the next column to the left that contains data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153554				0	gu	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + Right Arrow				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155593				0	gu	Moves the cursor to the right edge of the current data range. If the column to the right of the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves to the next column to the right that contains data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149317				0	gu	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + Up Arrow				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153076				0	gu	Moves the cursor to the top edge of the current data range. If the row above the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves up to the next row that contains data.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
