helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153536				0	gu	The letter "a" refers to the placeholder in your formula which you would like to assign to the respective formatting. You can substitute this character for any other you like.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
