helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154338				0	gu	Matrix stack				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3146941				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_MATRIX\"\>This icon inserts a matrix with four placeholders.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>matrix{<?>#<?>##<?>#<?>}\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window. The position of an element inside this diagram is indicated by two coordinates; the first specifies the line number and the second the column number. You can expand this matrix in any direction in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window by adding characters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
