helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147311	57			0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_WIDEHATX\"\>Inserts a wide circumflex ("hat") with a placeholder. \</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>widehat\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
