helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149372				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_SLRANGLEX\"\>Inserts scalable angle brackets with a placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>left langle <?> right rangle\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window. The size of the brackets is automatically adjusted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_idN10429				0	gu	\<image id=\"img_id3154235\" src=\"starmath/res/al21822.png\" width=\"0.25inch\" height=\"0.25inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154235\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
