helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148388				0	gu	Specifies the type of horizontal alignment for multi-line formulas.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150566				0	gu	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:RADIOBUTTON:RID_ALIGNDIALOG:1\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Aligns the selected elements of a formula to the left.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149709	21			0	gu	Text is always aligned left. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
