helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3148664				0	gu	\<emph\>Index:\</emph\> A numeric expression that specifies the value to return.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	gu	\<emph\>Selection1:\</emph\> Any expression that contains one of the possible choices.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3151043				0	gu	The \<emph\>Choose\</emph\> function returns a value from the list of expressions based on the index value. If Index = 1, the function returns the first expression in the list, if index i= 2, it returns the second expression, and so on.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090402.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	gu	If the index value is less than 1 or greater than the number of expressions listed, the function returns a Null value.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
