helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152924				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090412.xhp\" name=\"Exit Statement [Runtime]\"\>Exit Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	gu	Exits a \<emph\>Do...Loop\</emph\>, \<emph\>For...Next\</emph\>, a function, or a subroutine.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3159157				0	gu	see Parameter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3154760				0	gu	\<emph\>Exit Do\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3147559				0	gu	Only valid within a \<emph\>Do...Loop\</emph\> statement to exit the loop. Program execution continues with the statement that follows the Loop statement. If \<emph\>Do...Loop\</emph\> statements are nested, the control is transferred to the loop in the next higher level.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398				0	gu	\<emph\>Exit For\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	gu	Only valid within a \<emph\>For...Next\</emph\> loop to exit the loop. Program execution continues with the first statement that follows the \<emph\>Next\</emph\> statement. In nested statements, the control is transferred to the loop in the next higher level.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3147229				0	gu	\<emph\>Exit Function\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3154685				0	gu	Exits the \<emph\>Function\</emph\> procedure immediately. Program execution continues with the statement that follows the \<emph\>Function\</emph\> call.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3155132				0	gu	\<emph\>Exit Sub\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3149561				0	gu	Exits the subroutine immediately. Program execution continues with the statement that follows the \<emph\>Sub\</emph\> call.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3153143				0	gu	The Exit statement does not define the end of a structure, and must not be confused with the End statement.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
