helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3155066				0	gu	4 - RANDOM (file open for random access)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3148406				0	gu	8 - APPEND (file open for appending)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3154757				0	gu	32 - BINARY (file open in binary mode).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
