helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073				0	gu	Add \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/01050100.xhp\" name=\"watch\"\>watch\</link\> for the variable at the cursor				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3154731				0	gu	F7				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\keys.xhp	0	help	par_id3148455				0	gu	Single step through each statement, starting at the first line or at that statement where the program execution stopped before.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
