helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147560				0	gu	Integers				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159414				0	gu	\<emph\>Expression:\</emph\> Any numeric expression that you want to convert. If the \<emph\>Expression\</emph\> exceeds the value range between -32768 and 32767, $[officename] Basic reports an overflow error. To convert a string expression, the number must be entered as normal text ("123.5") using the default number format of your operating system.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120307.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gu	Right Function [Runtime]				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120307.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153311				0	gu	\<bookmark_value\>Right function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120307.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153311				0	gu	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03120307.xhp\" name=\"Right Function [Runtime]\"\>Right Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120307.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	gu	Returns the rightmost "n" characters of a string expression.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120307.xhp	0	help	par_id3149763				0	gu	See also: \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03120303.xhp\" name=\"Left Function\"\>Left Function\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
