helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156215				0	gu	Boolean expressions combined with AND only return the value \<emph\>True\</emph\> if both expressions evaluate to \<emph\>True\</emph\>:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
