helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156056				0	gu	You do not need to include the parameter of an event object if the object is not used:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150042				0	gu	' Minimal implementation of Sub disposing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
