helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3150359	9			0	gu	\<emph\>Start: \</emph\>Numeric expression that indicates the character position within the string where the string portion that you want to replace or to return begins. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3148451				0	gu	\<emph\>Length:\</emph\> Numeric expression that returns the number of characters that you want to replace or return. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864				0	gu	If the Length parameter in the \<emph\>Mid function\</emph\> is omitted, all characters in the string expression from the start position to the end of the string are returned.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762				0	gu	If the Length parameter in the \<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\> is less than the length of the text that you want to replace, the text is reduced to the specified length.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3150769				0	gu	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> The string to replace the string expression (\<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\>).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
